---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const title = 'Fair Use & Video Download Disclaimer | Clipora';
const description = 'Read Clipora’s video download fair use disclaimer: use media only with permission, respect creator rights and platform terms, and never bypass access controls.';
---

<LegalLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="policy-article">
    <p class="policy-eyebrow">LEGAL & SAFETY</p>
    <h1>Fair Use & Video Download Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="policy-lede">Clipora helps inspect media links and process available video or audio formats. A publicly reachable link does not automatically grant permission to download, copy, or reuse its contents.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Use media you are authorized to access</h2>
      <p>Only submit or save content that you own, have permission to use, or are otherwise legally entitled to access and copy. You are responsible for checking copyright, license terms, privacy rights, publicity rights, and any other restrictions that apply to the content and your intended use.</p>
      <p>Downloading a file does not transfer ownership or give you a license to publish, distribute, sell, modify, or publicly display it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>No circumvention of access controls</h2>
      <p>Do not use Clipora to bypass digital rights management, paywalls, passwords, account requirements, private settings, age gates, technical restrictions, or other access controls. Clipora is not intended to retrieve private, restricted, or unauthorized media.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Respect creators and platform rules</h2>
      <p>Creators and rights holders retain their rights in their work. Follow the terms of the website or platform where the media is hosted, as well as applicable copyright and consumer-protection laws. Do not remove attribution or watermarks, or misrepresent who created the material.</p>
      <p>Clipora is an independent service and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, X, Reddit, Vimeo, Twitch, Pinterest, Threads, or other media platforms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Availability and responsibility</h2>
      <p>Source access, format availability, captions, and processing results can change without notice. Clipora does not guarantee that a particular link or quality will be available. You are responsible for the links you submit and for how you use any resulting file.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Rights and legal notices</h2>
      <p>If you believe material is being used unlawfully, do not submit or redistribute it. Before public launch, the service operator should publish a monitored contact address and the process for receiving copyright, privacy, and other legal notices.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</LegalLayout>